WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Units expose errors. Convert all quantities to compatible units before using a formula.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
1,500 mm = 1.5 m; mixing mm and m without conversion makes a geometry result wrong by scale factors.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Error spotting

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A block diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of legal roadworthiness.

